---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions - CalorieAce"
  description="Read the terms and conditions for using the CalorieAce website and its calculators."
>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-charcoal">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm text-gray-soft">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 font-body text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          By accessing and using CalorieAce, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">2. Not Medical Advice</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The calculators, articles, and content on this site are for general informational purposes only and are not a substitute for professional medical, nutritional, or health advice. Always consult a qualified healthcare provider before making changes to your diet, exercise, or health routine.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">3. No Warranty of Accuracy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          While we aim for accuracy, calorie and macro estimates are based on general formulas and may not reflect your exact individual needs. We make no guarantees about the completeness or accuracy of any results provided by this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">4. Advertising</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site may display third-party advertisements, including through Google AdSense. We are not responsible for the content of advertisements shown on this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We are not liable for any decisions made or actions taken based on information provided by this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">6. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We may update these Terms & Conditions at any time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions about these terms? Visit our <a href="/contact-us" class="text-forest underline">Contact Us</a> page.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>